    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Green curry serves 4 and takes about 40 minutes from start to finish. The most important step is frying the paste in coconut cream before adding the rest of the liquid. That short fry builds the foundation of flavour."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use the thick cream from the top of an unshaken tin of coconut milk to fry the paste. If you can only find coconut milk that has already mixed together, use 2 tablespoons of vegetable oil instead."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
